     by downloading them from there or by carrying exact copies;
  b. the files are checked against the release's SHA256SUMS.txt;
  c. this LICENSE file is installed with them;
  d. the package is clearly marked as unofficial or community-maintained;
  e. you don't charge for the package.

Agistaris may withdraw this permission for a particular package or
repository by telling its maintainer.


